Package: hypermodR
Type: Package
Title: Hyperspectral Modelling and Validation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Planning-stage scaffold for interpretable and black-box
    hyperspectral modelling, image and sequence interoperability, reproducible
    evaluation, optional model runtimes, and an interactive research workbench.
    The documented interfaces are proposed and await implementation approval.
